":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]当然，到最后也只有几个人能留下。毕竟大环境如此，还有心情舞蹈的妖精并不算多。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]啊啦，到了该提醒新人们锻炼体力的时间了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]要来看看她们能坚持多久吗？亲自观看训练现场，这可是合作伙伴的特别待遇唷。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"拉碧丝-友善3","script":"yd_007_03"}